      "filename": "Amphibolite with alaskite granite dike (Neoarchean; Rt. 212 roadcut, Beartooth Mountains, Montana, USA) 1 (29687155532).jpg",
      "title": "File:Amphibolite with alaskite granite dike (Neoarchean; Rt. 212 roadcut, Beartooth Mountains, Montana, USA) 1 (29687155532).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/46/Amphibolite_with_alaskite_granite_dike_%28Neoarchean%3B_Rt._212_roadcut%2C_Beartooth_Mountains%2C_Montana%2C_USA%29_1_%2829687155532%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Amphibolite_with_alaskite_granite_dike_(Neoarchean;_Rt._212_roadcut,_Beartooth_Mountains,_Montana,_USA)_1_(29687155532).jpg",
      "width": 2184,
